# render_state_misc: State with no pixel of its own, each set inside a pass that then draws: 0x17 memory barrier scope, 0x85 TextureBarrier, 0x18 and 0x19 fences (ref 0 throws "Got invalid Fence"; a buffer ref faults), 0x86 and 0x1b UseHeaps (a private heap; a count past the record throws "Too many resources specified"; 257 refs take the heap-allocated list), 0x87 and 0x89 UseResources (a ref that is not a resource resolves to nil), 0x7b tessellation factor scale, 0x88 line width, 0x8a alpha test, 0x8b point size, 0x8f viewport transform, 0x90 provoking vertex, 0x91 primitive restart, 0x99 and 0x9a vertex amplification with an amplification-capable pipeline, 0x97 and 0x98 depth and stencil resolve textures, 0x96 colour resolve with two attachments. 0x16 RenderBarrierResources always throws "unsupported".
